#: .\templates\HC\HChelp.html:21
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "<LI>The active player has a yellow highlight</LI> <LI>Click on a player's "
#| "name to view their factory - their name will get a green border to show "
#| "you are looking at their factory. You can also click their name again as "
#| "a shortcut to go back to the Market Board screen</LI> <LI>If the pieces "
#| "are obscuring the Tech Track, click the \"Hide Pieces\" button, next to "
#| "the Min Specs board</LI> <LI>Factory building can be done simultaneously."
#| "<BR /> If you are not first in turn order, you can submit your factory "
#| "and it will be verified in turn order.<BR /> In the lobby, you will show "
#| "up under \"current players\" until your factory is verified<BR /> In this "
#| "case the game won't have the green \"Your Move\" highlight until you need "
#| "to make a move again.<BR /> If previous players use up the components, "
#| "factory building will be re-enabled and you will need to remove those "
#| "components.<BR /> To prevent losing your factory mid-build, the game "
#| "won't update live during this phase. Check the lobby or refresh your "
#| "game<br /> - you will also be sent a notification once you need to move, "
#| "if you have enabled this in your profile. </LI> <LI>During factory "
#| "building, a tech level summary is displayed. <BR /> Your techs have a bar "
#| "with a green outline<BR /> Techs you have access to this turn (but have "
#| "not researched yourself) have a bar with a yellow outline </LI>"
msgid ""
"<li>The active player has a yellow highlight</li> <li> Click on a player's "
"name to view their factory - their name will get a green border to show you "
"are looking at their factory. You can also click their name again as a "
"shortcut to go back to the Market Board screen </li> <li>If the pieces are "
"obscuring the Tech Track, click the \"Hide Pieces\" button, next to the Min "
"Specs board</li> <li> Factory building can be done simultaneously. <br /> If "
"you are not first in turn order, you can submit your factory and it will be "
"verified in turn order. <br /> In the lobby, you will show up under "
"\"current players\" until your factory is verified <br /> In this case the "
"game won't have the green \"Your Move\" highlight until you need to make a "
"move again. <br /> If previous players use up the components, factory "
"building will be re-enabled and you will need to remove those components. "
"<br /> To prevent losing your factory mid-build, the game won't update live "
"during this phase. Check the lobby or refresh your game <br /> - you will "
"also be sent a notification once you need to move, if you have enabled this "
"in your profile. </li> <li> During factory building, a tech level summary is "
"displayed. <br /> Your techs have a bar with a green outline <br /> Techs "
"you have access to this turn (but have not researched yourself) have a bar "
"with a yellow outline </li>"
msgstr ""
"<LI>当前玩家有一个黄色突出显示</LI><LI>点击玩家的名字可以查看他们的工厂-他们"
"的名字会有一个绿色边框，显示你正在查看他们的厂。你也可以再次单击它们的名称作"
"为返回市场版图屏幕的快捷方式</LI><LI>如果组件遮挡了技术轨道，请单击最小规格板"
"旁边的“隐藏组件”按钮</LI><LI>工厂建设可以同时进行<BR/>如果你不是第一顺位玩"
"家，您可以提交您的工厂，并将依次进行验证<BR/>在大厅中，您将显示在“当前玩"
"家”下，直到您的工厂得到验证<BR/>在这种情况下，在您需要再次移动之前，游戏不会"
"有绿色的“您的移动”高亮显示<BR/>如果以前的玩家用完了这些组件，工厂建设将重新启"
"用，您需要移除这些组件<BR/>为了防止在构建中期丢失您的工厂，游戏在此阶段不会进"
"行实时更新。检查大厅或刷新您的游戏<br/>-如果您在个人资料中启用了移动功能，您"
"还将在需要移动时收到通知</LI><LI>在工厂建设期间，将显示科技级别摘要<BR/>您的"
"科技是含有一个绿色轮廓线<BR/>您可以访问此回合的技术（但尚未自行研究）含有一个"
"黄色轮廓线</LI>"

#: .\templates\HC\HChelp.html:56
msgid "How can I see which Market Windows have been placed?"
msgstr "如何查看放置了哪些市场窗口？"

#: .\templates\HC\HChelp.html:58
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Any dealership with sales potential will be shown under the player names. "
#| "Clicking on a dealership with a placed Market Window will show you the "
#| "remaining squares it can sell to. If the Market Window has not been "
#| "placed, then all eligible squares will be highlighted. <BR/> The Market "
#| "Windows also have a name on them, in the top left, althought this can be "
#| "obscured if other Market Windows are placed on top."
msgid ""
"Any dealership with sales potential will be shown under the player names. "
"Clicking on a dealership with a placed Market Window will show you the "
"remaining squares it can sell to. If the Market Window has not been placed, "
"then all eligible squares will be highlighted. <br /> The Market Windows "
"also have a name on them, in the top left, althought this can be obscured if "
"other Market Windows are placed on top."
msgstr ""
"任何有销售潜力的经销商都将显示在玩家名称下。点击具有已放置市场窗口的经销商，"
"将显示其可以出售的剩余方格。如果尚未放置市场窗口，则所有符合条件的广场都将突"
"出显示<BR/>市场窗口的左上角也有一个名称，尽管如果其他市场窗口放在顶部，这可能"
"会被掩盖。"

#: .\templates\HC\HChelp.html:66
msgid ""
"I am second in Engineering Focus. Why can't I build techs from people with "
"lower Engineering Focus?"
msgstr ""
"我是工程焦点顺位的第二名。为什么我不能从工程关注度较低的人那里建造技术站？"

#: .\templates\HC\HChelp.html:68
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "From the rulebook: \"The player with the second highest engineering focus "
#| "has access to every technology researched by at least two players; the "
#| "third, to any researched by three others; and the fourth to any research "
#| "done by 4 players already.\"<BR/> So in fact, you can build techs you "
#| "haven't researched, but it must have been researched by at least 2 "
#| "players. If there is a tech that has only been researched by one person, "
#| "even if they are lower in engineering focus, then you will not have "
#| "access to it."
msgid ""
"From the rulebook: \"The player with the second highest engineering focus "
"has access to every technology researched by at least two players; the "
"third, to any researched by three others; and the fourth to any research "
"done by 4 players already.\" <br /> So in fact, you can build techs you "
"haven't researched, but it must have been researched by at least 2 players. "
"If there is a tech that has only been researched by one person, then you "
"will not have access to it, even if they are lower in engineering focus."
msgstr ""
"根据规则手册：“工程焦点第二高的玩家可以使用至少二名玩家研究的每一项技术；第三"
"名玩家可以使用其他三名玩家研究过的任何技术；第四名玩家可以访问已经由四名玩家"
"进行过的任何研究。”。如果有一项技术只由一个人研究，即使他们的工程关注度较低，"
"那么你也无法获得它。"

#: .\templates\HC\HChelp.html:79
msgid "Why do I have to have a set focus turn if there is only one slot left?"
msgstr "如果只剩下一个顺位槽，为什么我必须进行焦点设置？"

#: .\templates\HC\HChelp.html:81
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "You are probably missing a crucial point; you are now in the situation "
#| "where if you were to go over 10 Gantt and there is only 1 clock left, "
#| "then you can decide if the game ends or goes another round. Pretty "
#| "important really! So I decided to leave the game as per the actual rules, "
#| "rather thank try to make a skip. <BR/>Additionally, the factory building "
#| "phase happens before Gantt are increased, so it's basically impossible to "
#| "know if someone below 10 Gantt will end up above or below 10 after the "
#| "end of the factory building phase. <BR/>Similarly, if someone is on 10 "
#| "Gantt or higher, they might wish to spend them all right now in order to "
#| "reset their Gantt, for example, if they only have 5 Planning Departments, "
#| "and wish to have the opportunity to decrease the punchclock number in a "
#| "later turn."
msgid ""
"You are probably missing a crucial point; you are now in the situation where "
"if you were to go over 10 Gantt and there is only 1 clock left, then you can "
"decide if the game ends or goes another round. Pretty important really! So I "
"decided to leave the game as per the actual rules, rather than making a "
"skip. <br /> Additionally, the factory building phase happens before Gantt "
"are increased, so it's basically impossible to know if someone below 10 "
"Gantt will end up above or below 10 after the end of the factory building "
"phase. <br /> Similarly, if someone is on 10 Gantt or higher, they might "
"wish to spend them all right now in order to reset their Gantt, for example, "
"if they only have 5 Planning Departments, and wish to have the opportunity "
"to decrease the punchclock number in a later turn."
msgstr ""
"你可能错过了一个关键点；你现在的处境是，如果你超过10甘特点数，只剩下1考勤钟，"
"那么你可以决定游戏是当前回合结束还是下一回合奇数。真的很重要！所以我决定按照"
"实际规则离开游戏，更确切地说，谢谢你试着略过。<BR/>此外，工厂建设阶段发生在甘"
"特点数增加之前，因此基本上不可能知道甘特点数低于10的人在工厂建设阶段结束后是"
"高于还是低于10<BR/>同样，如果有人的甘特点数为10或更高，他们可能希望现在就全部"
"用完，以便重新设置甘特点数，例如，如果他们只有5个规划部门，并且希望有机会在以"
"后的一回合中减少考勤钟时间。"

